{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07284","headline":"自道林寺西入石路至麓山寺过法崇禅师故居 · 刘长卿","name":"自道林寺西入石路至麓山寺过法崇禅师故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山僧候谷口，石路拂莓苔。\n深入泉源去，遥从树杪回。\n香随青霭散，钟过白云来。\n野雪空斋掩，山风古殿开。\n桂寒知自发，松老问谁栽。\n惆怅湘江水，何人更渡杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}